square (0,0) (4,0) (4,4) (0,4)
(2,2): inside (the middle)
(4,2): on the boundary (on the right edge)
(5,2): outside (level with the edge, but beyond it)
diamond (2,0) (4,2) (2,4) (0,2)
(1,2): inside (the ray to the right passes through the corner (4,2))
(-1,2): outside (the ray passes through the corners (0,2) and (4,2))
